title: The Mimic Shelf
portrait left: seeker

A shelf that is slightly too neat. The spines are all the same colour. One of them is breathing.
There is something shiny behind the third book.

choice:
  - Reach for it -> reach
  - Leave it alone -> leave

@reach
  > fight mossback-beetle,page-wisp,page-wisp reward:double
  The shelf snaps shut on nothing. Whatever was behind it is yours now.
  > end

@leave
  You back away. The shelf exhales.
  > end
